<title>MEXICO: Mexico tourism receipts seen 6 pct higher in 1997.</title>
<headline>Mexico tourism receipts seen 6 pct higher in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico could see tourism receipts of $7.5 billion in 1997, six percent higher than revenues in 1996, Tourism Minister Silvia Hernandez said.</p>
<p>&quot;I am sure that we are going to have at least six percent more revenues this year compared to last year. We are talking about $7.5 billion,&quot; Hernandez said during a working visit to this northern Mexican industrial city.</p>
<p>((--Jacqueline Lerma, Monterrey bureau +528 3457677))</p>
